# Keeps this directory in version control while its CONTENTS stay ignored.
#
# artifacts/ holds machine-local experiment output:
#   runs/<run_id>/checkpoint/    model weights   (large, never committed)
#   runs/<run_id>/metrics.json   measured results
#   runs/<run_id>/env.json       captured environment
#   cache/                       tokenized feature caches
#
# Checkpoints are registered with `lightning model` and the small metrics JSON is
# copied into reports/ and committed there. See docs/lightning-workflow.md.
